  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Lazy/Unemployed Characterization",
  "description": "The meme implicitly relies on the stereotype that Black people are inherently lazy or unproductive, as evidenced by the claim that they are 'idiots' who are 'drinking beer, smoking weed, and shooting off Chinese fireworks' instead of protesting. This stereotype is used to justify historical oppression and is a common element of racist discourse.",
